{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日さむい～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝飲むここあが染みます、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/12/02/8411280/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつの間にか12月、、\nついこの前年明けした気がする:(´◦ω◦｀):"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月は、\nクリスマスライブとアンダーライブですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんきてくれますかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにひなは、\nハートサイリウムですよ。(色は何でも可)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"探しますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/12/02/8411280/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕張の個別握手会\nきてくれた方ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/12/02/8411280/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/12/02/8411280/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時期的に\nクリスマスのお話をけっこうしたかも(*´-`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年のクリスマスは、20-21だよね？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/12/02/8411280/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あともう\n良いお年を！をけっこういいましたっ\nなんか不思議～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写メるの忘れてしまったけど、\nリズリサコーデでしたっ\nいつもと違うと好評でした気がする"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/12/02/8411280/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実家から\nみかんや柿、キウイなどの\n果物が送られてきました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/12/02/8411280/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"柿とキュウイは、おじいちゃんからです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"陽菜のこといつも応援してくれて\n今回乃木坂46は、\n紅白出場で恩返し出来るかなっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みかんは長崎のです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長崎のみかんは甘くてすごーく美味しいよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんの地元の美味しいもの教えて下さい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/12/02/8411280/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/12/02/8411280/0007.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}